 simple codes, broadcast your lobbies, and hang out with friends globally.\n\nFREQUENT UPDATES: Dive into fresh features, seasonal map rotations, and exciting new items designed to keep the chase thrilling.", "short_description": "RIPPLE TAG\n\nSwing, run, and scale your way to victory in Ripple Tag, the ultimate fast-paced physics-based multiplayer tag game! Created by Direct, this game takes high-speed chase mechanics to the next level with incredibly smooth locomotion, customizable lobbies, and non-stop action.\n\n\ud83c\udf1f GAME FEATURES:\n\nCLASSIC LOCOMOTION: Master the iconic physics-based movement where your arms are your only tools to climb, jump, and escape other players.\n\nSHINY ROCKS & COSMETICS: Earn in-ga"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1n1BGY97-1GIVr5-3sqzEmORXE2dvZzUOxO4aIU0W60k/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Direct", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1roWAsCqObZGE4y1dgyuEXqxl-ECy46063wB9GMwpEgw/edit?usp=sharing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "1152651841273112"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821704_1347578420772913_8985441086994035061_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat